### --- PARTICIPATION TESTS ---

### Join event (use a real eventId from your events table, and the userId from above)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/events/1/join?userId=1

### List participants
GET http://localhost:8080/api/events/1/participants

### Try joining again (should fail with "User already joined this event")
POST http://localhost:8080/api/events/1/join?userId=1

### Count participants
GET http://localhost:8080/api/events/1/participants/count

### Leave event
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/events/1/leave?userId=1

### Confirm the participant is gone
GET http://localhost:8080/api/events/1/participants